{{Term/Store|Amber Earrings|Amber Earrings|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
Amber Earrings are a type of [[Accessory]], specifically [[Earring]]s that can be clipped onto [[Link]]'s ears.<ref name="BotW Book"/> They can be purchased at the [[Starlight Memories]] [[Jewelry Shop]] in [[Gerudo Town]] for 100 [[Rupee]]s and ten pieces of [[Amber]].<ref name="BotW Isha"/> The Amber in the Earrings harnesses the land's power, giving them increased defense compared to most other [[Armor]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/>

Amber Earrings can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]. However, they cannot be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. The Earrings have no other use than to increase Link's defense.

